<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., aviation rated Aa3 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., aviation rated Aa3 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, May 6 - The assignment of Moody's Aa3 rating for Miami International Airport's outstanding debt, in conjunction with a $75 million refunding issue, rests on a number of strengths, including Miami's large origination and destination market, its role as a primary gateway fo North American traffic to Latin America, and its sound financial operations that have been historically linked to a strong facility control.</p>
</text>
